  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39648990",
      "title": "Setting Up The Starting Project",
      "sourceHash": "ddd860814b374e96dd8a6fbcecf285c862aee1b07e0a463c34b5d275cb4d9cca",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 4.02,
          "en": "Now that we know what the general idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.02,
          "end": 7.92,
          "en": "behind components is and why working with components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "is so popular, it's time to switch to our React project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "and get started with components and with writing code there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "And therefore, attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 22.32,
          "en": "you find a CodeSandbox link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.32,
          "end": 25.44,
          "en": "to a React project I prepared for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.44,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "which is the starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "for the demo project we're going to work on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 32.223,
          "en": "throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "Now, if you don't want to use this browser based environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 41.13,
          "en": "and if you instead prefer to follow along locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 44.31,
          "en": "you can also use this alternative zip file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.31,
          "end": 46.2,
          "en": "which you'll also find attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.2,
          "end": 49.623,
          "en": "which once you've downloaded and extracted it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.837,
          "end": 52.77,
          "en": "will of course give you that same starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.77,
          "end": 55.11,
          "en": "Now just a project which you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.11,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "and run locally on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "If you go for this local option instead of using CodeSandbox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "you should open this extracted folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 68.19,
          "en": "with any code editor of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.19,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "for example, Visual Studio Code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 73.17,
          "en": "And then there in that project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.17,
          "end": 76.65,
          "en": "you first of all have to run NPM install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.65,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "in your system terminal navigated into that project folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 83.43,
          "en": "This command will download",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.43,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "and install any third party packages needed by this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.3,
          "en": "For example, the React libraries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.3,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "and the build process tools that watch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 95.22,
          "en": "and transform the React code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.22,
          "end": 97.49799999999999,
          "en": "to code that works in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.49799999999999,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "Because as mentioned in the first course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "by default, the code you write in React projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 106.563,
          "en": "would not run in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "Now after successfully running NPM install,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "which is something you only need to do once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "you can run NPM run dev to start the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "This development server will allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "to visit a preview website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.78,
          "end": 126.63,
          "en": "where you can see your React app in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.63,
          "end": 129.84,
          "en": "You should keep this development server process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.84,
          "end": 133.14,
          "en": "up and running for as long as you are working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.14,
          "end": 135.81,
          "en": "on this project because behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.81,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "this process will watch your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "and reload that preview website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "whenever you make changes to the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 146.16,
          "en": "You will find that preview website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 148.92000000000002,
          "en": "by visiting this address that's output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 151.11,
          "en": "after running NPM run dev.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "As mentioned, it's the same starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 155.94,
          "en": "and therefore the same demo website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.94,
          "end": 159,
          "en": "as you find it in that CodeSandbox environment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "There, if you are using CodeSandbox,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 165.957,
          "en": "you don't need to run NPM install or NPM run dev",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.957,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "because CodeSandbox will do that for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 170.85,
          "en": "Now in your local project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 173.19,
          "en": "you can quit this running development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.19,
          "end": 176.7,
          "en": "with Ctrl + C whenever you're done for the day.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "And if you then want to start coding again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 181.95,
          "en": "you can simply restart it by running NPM run dev again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 183.81,
          "en": "Again, this is all not required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.81,
          "end": 186.273,
          "en": "if you're using the CodeSandbox environment.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}